[9.780502, "o", "--- MAP ---\r\n"]
[9.78204, "o", "gasket hopper layout\r\n====================\r\n\r\ngaskcli/boot.rs dispatches bind, jab, and cork.\r\n\r\nPipeline modules:\r\n- loomkit/  roster writer\r\n- rimcap/   compiled span\r\n- hopmat/   live hop table\r\n- lidpit/   seal writer\r\n- slipread/ card parse\r\n\r\nCards live in /app/buscards.\r\nbind refreshes /app/mistwell/roster.json and /app/loomkit/emit.lst.\r\ncork writes /app/corkbay/seal.json.\r\nFixture copies of the cards sit at /app/cardbak/buscards.\r\n\r\nRebuild the binary with /app/stoke.sh after source edits.\r\n"]
[9.782249, "o", "--- CARDS ---\r\n"]
[9.785866, "o", "/app/buscards/g_bias.card\r\n"]
[9.789402, "o", "LABEL TRIM_BIAS\r\nWIRE 12\r\nREPLY bias-ok\r\n"]
[9.789791, "o", "/app/buscards/f_latch.card\r\n"]
[9.791115, "o", "LABEL HOLD_LATCH\r\nWIRE 10\r\nREPLY latch-ok\r\n"]
[9.791444, "o", "/app/buscards/a_fan.card\r\n"]
[9.793927, "o", "LABEL SET_FAN\r\nWIRE 1\r\nREPLY fan-ok\r\n"]
[9.794247, "o", "/app/buscards/i_vent.card\r\n"]
[9.797026, "o", "LABEL VENT_LINE\r\nWIRE 17\r\nREPLY vent-ok\r\n"]
[9.797321, "o", "/app/buscards/c_valve.card\r\n"]
[9.799014, "o", "LABEL SET_VALVE\r\nWIRE 4\r\nREPLY valve-ok\r\n"]
[9.799302, "o", "/app/buscards/b_pump.card\r\n"]
[9.801882, "o", "LABEL SET_PUMP\r\nWIRE 2\r\nREPLY pump-ok\r\n"]
[9.802955, "o", "/app/buscards/e_press.card\r\n"]
